305
00:24:45,600 --> 00:24:46,570
Yu Changxuan!

306
00:24:48,570 --> 00:24:50,240
Stop beating him!

307
00:24:50,940 --> 00:24:51,480
Beat him!

308
00:24:53,140 --> 00:24:54,110
Yu Changxuan!

309
00:24:54,140 --> 00:24:55,810
Fight back!

310
00:24:57,530 --> 00:24:59,290
Fight back!

311
00:25:02,050 --> 00:25:03,820
Stop beating him!

312
00:25:05,730 --> 00:25:09,100
