411
00:32:58,660 --> 00:32:59,720
Thank you, Doctor.

412
00:33:00,550 --> 00:33:01,480
You're welcome.

413
00:33:01,570 --> 00:33:02,100
Let's go.

414
00:33:10,310 --> 00:33:11,070
